flowchart TD
    Start([Start Inpatient Admission]) --> ReceiveRecommendation[Receive IP Admission Order]
    ReceiveRecommendation --> CheckActiveAdm{Active Admission Exists?}
    CheckActiveAdm -- Yes --> BlockAdmission[Reject - Active IP Stay Exists] --> End([End Admission])
    CheckActiveAdm -- No --> SelectWard[Select Preferred Ward Category]
    SelectWard --> QueryBeds[Query Real-Time Ward Bed Occupancy]
    QueryBeds --> BedAvailable{Available Bed Found?}
    BedAvailable -- No --> AlertFullWard[Alert Full Ward & Offer Alternate Ward] --> SelectWard
    BedAvailable -- Yes --> AllocateBed[Assign Bed & Update Bed Status = Occupied]
    AllocateBed --> CreateIPRecord[Set Admission Status = BedAllocated]
    CreateIPRecord --> IssueIPCard[Issue Inpatient Admission Card & Notify Ward]
    IssueIPCard --> End
